/ Field of a text setting with the toolbar of the text formatting, in a
/ settings form built from the declared settings (declared wide, the toolbar
/ is a block and cannot stand in a paragraph). Its class lets the form use the
/ full width the toolbar needs
.form-field
  = additionals_settings_textarea setting[:key],
                                  value:,
                                  tag_name:,
                                  label: setting[:label],
                                  required: setting[:required],
                                  class: 'settings-wiki-text',
                                  wiki_toolbar: true
